│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Add a lightweight BFS distance routine using the current passability map and tentative    │
│                          │ walls, then use that true path distance when evaluating wall targets. Unreachable         │
│                          │ candidates are ignored. This preserves the existing strategy while substantially          │
│                          │ improving its ability to finish partially constructed enclosures.                         │
