│                          │ A partition is only useful once its boundary becomes connected. Prefer cells adjoining    │
│                          │ existing walls so that humans extend already-started boundary segments rather than        │
│                          │ scattering isolated wall cells. Also apply a modest penalty to cells close to pets (while │
│                          │ still allowing them when necessary), since these cells are more likely to become          │
│                          │ temporarily illegal on following turns as pets move.                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The weights are deliberately small compared with the 1000 own-strip-side preference, so   │
│                          │ workers still build their assigned enclosure and do not make excessive detours.           │
